WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.400
We are first introduced to Dante Bishop on
March 21st 2022 in Southern California.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.670
He’s homeless and he’s being stalked by
a group of Purgers who describe themselves

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.459
as fine young very educated guys and gals.

00:00:10.459 --> 00:00:12.510
They wear creepy brown masks and fancy clothes.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:16.240
It’s not known why they target him, but
it’s entirely possible that being homeless,

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.550
he thought he’d fare better hiding in an
upscale residential neighborhood whose residents

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.929
are less likely to be on the streets for their
Purge, than those in the inner city, but his

00:00:22.929 --> 00:00:26.900
assumption was sadly mistaken when he encountered their group, and just happened to be

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.939
the first homeless person they came across.

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:32.410
They have a mission to take out the homeless
and the lower class because wiping out that

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:36.379
demographic means paying less on taxes that
support things like food stamps and homeless

00:00:36.379 --> 00:00:36.943
shelters.

00:00:36.943 --> 00:00:40.290
It’s clear based on the way they talk about
him, that they look down on the homeless.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.980
“The man you are sheltering is nothing but
a dirty homeless pig.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.660
A grotesque menace to our just society who
had the audacity to fight back.”

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.030
So when the group encounters Dante, they see
that he’s homeless and they go after him,

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.940
but things don’t go as expected.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:56.590
To learn about how Dante’s experiences that
night were instrumental in putting a stop

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:00.455
to The Purge once and for all, stick around
to the end of this video.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.420
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.130
Today’s episode will break down one of the
most unlikely characters to become a hero

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.200
in the world of The Purge.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.340
When he was first introduced, Edwin Hodge’s
character only spoke on maybe four separate

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.400
occasions and was known in the credits simply
as Bloody Stranger.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:22.820
Then in Anarchy, he makes a small appearance,
but this time he isn’t bloody, so he’s

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.979
credited as The Stranger.

00:01:23.979 --> 00:01:28.380
It isn’t until the third movie that we learn
who he is and how his experiences changed

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.380
history.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.670
So, to understand his story, let’s take
it back to just before he shows up for the

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.119
first time in the series.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:43.520
Surrounded by this strange group of gussied
up Purge participants, he surprises them by

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.520
fighting back.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:48.380
He probably did this with knife he had with
him, and he actually manages to “purge”

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.380
one of them.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.590
After doing this, he runs for it.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:54.299
I imagine the purgers were too busy tending
to their friend to bother going after him

00:01:54.299 --> 00:01:57.430
right away, but they would soon follow him
with revenge in mind.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:01.490
Dante runs down the street in a gated residential
community and tries to call out for help to

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:02.740
the local residents.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.980
“Help me!

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.469
Someone please help me!”

00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:10.580
His prayers are answered when the Sandin household
lifts their security and a young boy yells

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:11.580
out to him.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.990
He makes a sprint for it and manages to slide
under the closing door just in time.

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:19.020
He may be safe from his original attackers,
however, for all he knows, the Sandin family

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.820
is also looking to purge him.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.850
They have blue baptisias outside, a sign that
they support The Purge, but not necessarily

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:27.520
a sign that they participate in The Purge
themselves.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.820
Taking the shelter is Dante’s best bet,
but he still has to stay on his toes.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.830
It quickly becomes apparent that this kid
is the only one reason he was let inside when

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.290
the parents emerge in a state of anger and
confusion.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:41.120
The dad slowly draws his gun on Dante, but
his focus is diverted when a young man on

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:42.970
the stairs opens fire on Mr. Sandin.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.000
The distraction gives Dante a chance to escape
and hide in the house.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.650
He’s probably planning to try to avoid the
family until The Purge ended the next morning,

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.840
but he realizes the family isn’t his only
concern when the power is cut in the entire

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.340
house.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.110
As he’s searching for a spot, he nearly
gets caught when Mr. Sandin shines a flashlight

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.590
on him with his gun drawn.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:03.260
The darkness works to Dante’s advantage
here, and he’s able to disappear once more.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.760
He ducks out behind a couch in a living room
when he’s approached by a strange drone

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.920
shaped like a creepy deformed baby doll.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.920
When it spots him, nobody comes running to
his location to capture him, so he’s intrigued

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.790
by what it’s purpose is and decides to follow
it, perhaps thinking it was being controlled

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.400
by the boy who let him inside.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.430
If that was his logic, he would have been
correct.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:24.180
It leads him into a closet where he discovers
a hidden area covered up by a panel, and he

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.250
takes refuge there just before Mrs. Sandin
enters the room.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.280
She searches the closet, and he readies his
knife, but ultimately is not discovered.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:35.040
That doesn’t last long however, because
the Sandins’ daughter Zoe also tries to

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:39.320
hide there, and not wanting to kill anyone,
Dante has no choice but to take her hostage.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:42.630
The threat doesn’t really work out for him
though, because he was never going to shoot

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:46.370
Zoe, he’s not violent by nature and killing
her wouldn’t get him anywhere.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.150
In a stand-off with Mr. Sandin, he explains
that he doesn’t want to hurt any of them,

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.840
but he deserves to survive the night just
as much as they do.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.950
He finds out that the purge group he escaped
from has threatened the Sandins’ lives if

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.260
they don’t turn him back over.

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.680
Meanwhile, Mrs. Sandin sneaks up behind him,
and he has to abandon his plan.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.700
He throws Zoe into the wall and tries to run
for it, but he’s brought down by Mr. Sandin.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.430
He flails and struggles, but is forced to
cooperate when Mr. Sandin restrains him and

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.280
his wife brutally cuts into his wound with
a letter opener.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.950
Dante is duct taped to a chair where he sees
how much turmoil he is causing the family

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.250
and concedes his struggle.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.768
“Save your children.

00:04:22.435 --> 00:04:23.787
Take me outside.”

00:04:23.787 --> 00:04:28.660
It is perhaps this humility, that causes Mr.
Sandin to decide he’s had enough of being

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.070
pushed around by the purgers outside the house.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:36.220
He leaves Dante in restraints upstairs unsupervised,
giving him time to wiggle out and free himself.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:39.690
Once again, he hides somewhere in the house,
as he hears the Sandin family fight for their

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.430
lives and his own.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:45.180
At some point, he must have felt guilty for
hiding while the man who risked everything

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:49.850
for him, a stranger, was being massacred downstairs,
and he decides he’s going to return the

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.401
favor.

00:04:50.401 --> 00:04:53.320
The other neighbors take care of the threat
of the masked purge group, but only because

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.590
they want to take out the Sandins themselves.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.660
Dante finds himself a weapon and the controller
for the creepy baby drone, and just as the

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:03.570
neighbors are about to sacrifice the family,
he runs the RC vehicle across the foyer to

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.640
distract everyone, allowing him to get into
position to go to town on the neighbors -- knocking

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:11.410
the first one out with fist, taking out another
with his gun and grabbing the woman, Grace,

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.410
as a hostage.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.630
He forces the remaining neighbors to drop
their weapons and untie the remainder of the

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:19.270
family, but once they are safe, he refuses
to engage in any more violence.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:22.960
He watches over everyone as they all sit at
the kitchen table and wait for The Purge to

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:23.960
expire.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.160
After the sirens sounds, Dante is the last
to leave.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:30.310
He places the gun on the table, and when Mary
thanks him for saving them all he can muster

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:31.310
is…

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.310
“Good luck.”

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:36.660
The psychological damage of the horrors he
experienced that night would change the course

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.310
of the rest of Dante’s life.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.920
He had seen first hand what The Purge was
doing to his country, and his new mission

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.750
would be to put a stop to it.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:47.960
Sometime over the next year he joins an anti-Purge
revolutionary group headed up by a man named

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.960
Carmelo Johns.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:53.390
Carmelo’s thesis is that The Purge is a
tool to funnel wealth upward to the NFFA political

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.580
party through killing.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.290
He aims to educate people about that and protect
those who would be victims.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.110
This makes it a perfect organisation for Dante
to be a part of, given that his lack of wealth

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:07.470
in 2022 gave him no way to protect himself,
and that nearly resulted in him being purged.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.980
“This year, we will fight back!”

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:15.440
During the 2023 Purge, Carmelo’s group hacks
into the NFFA countdown stream at the 6-hour

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:18.931
mark and issues a propaganda warning, claiming
that their message will be written in the

00:06:18.931 --> 00:06:20.230
blood of their opponents.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.810
This shows us that Dante’s views have changed
since the previous year, where he was only

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:26.480
willing to engage in violence for survival
purposes.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.748
This year he’d be coming fully armed.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:43.370
The anti-NFFA revolutionary group led by Carmelo
Johns spends their 2023 Purge trying find

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:47.590
and break up an NFFA Purge Night Gala, where
rich political donors have the option to buy

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.430
into a controlled environment where they can
shoot down unarmed victims for sport.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.370
Dante is a part of this mission, which requires
him to break one of the few laws upheld during

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:59.560
The Purge: using weapons class 5 and above
-- in this case explosives that helped them

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.840
gain entry to the building.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:06.570
“The use of explosives higher than class
four is prohibited on Purge night.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.330
You will be prosecuted.”

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:12.260
Dante leads the way, striking down the NFFA
security guards and announcing to the victims

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.419
that they’re here to help and that they
should hold their fire.

00:07:14.419 --> 00:07:17.990
He’s also the first one to reach them and
explain who they are, and what they’re doing

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:18.990
there.

00:07:19.058 --> 00:07:20.426
EVA: “Who the f*** are you?”

00:07:20.834 --> 00:07:21.834
DANTE: “Nobody special.

00:07:21.834 --> 00:07:25.460
Just some people who don’t necessarily agree with The
Purge is all.”

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.240
He recommends that they get out before things
get nasty, and Carmelo’s group forms a line

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:33.050
and combs the room, taking out everyone associated
with the NFFA.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.300
Since Dante’s identity was not covered,
it’s likely that he had to go into hiding

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:39.220
to avoid being arrested for his use of high
class explosives.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:43.530
It may also be possible that it was too dark
in there for any cameras to pick up his identity,

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:47.860
or that he actually was prosecuted for illegal
use of explosives but was eventually released

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.960
from prison, however I find that idea pretty
unlikely based on the fact that in the world

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:55.650
of The Purge, trespassing after the sirens
sound gets your the death penalty.

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:59.290
It’s hard to imagine the penalty for using
illegal weapons would be any less.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:03.280
It is not known what happened to Carmelo Johns,
but at some point, Bishop assumes leadership

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:07.870
of the anti-NFFA militia and brings on a man
named Angel to be his second in command.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:11.450
During his time in charge of the organization,
he sets up a series of underground triage

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:15.940
centers staffed with doctors and medical supplies
meant as an alternate form of protest against

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.160
what goes on during The Purge.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:21.169
He also invites the homeless to take shelter
there, likely in honor of Charlie Sandin who

00:08:21.169 --> 00:08:23.500
offered him shelter when he was on the streets.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.730
Seventeen years after breaking up the gala,
Dante finds himself in Washington DC at the

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.699
heart of the protest against the Purge in
the year 2040.

00:08:30.699 --> 00:08:34.680
The NFFA this year is facing the greatest
threat to The Purge yet, because a new political

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.710
candidate named Charlie Roan has gained enough
popularity to threaten the NFFA’s regime.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:42.510
That’s why Dante has taken his talents to
the nation’s capital, where he gives a statement

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:44.460
on the 11 o’clock news.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:50.770
“For the past 20 years, the NFFA has taken
a legalized murder to decresase the poor population,

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.760
which in turn keeps the government spending
down.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.180
Less welfare.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.440
Less healthcare.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:57.440
Less housing.”

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:01.870
Feeling threatened by Senator Roan, the NFFA
institutes a new law that removes the exemption

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.800
for high ranking government officials.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:07.270
Just as Dante once tried to use the Sandin
family’s own weapons against them, he sees

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:12.040
this as an opportunity to take out the NFFA’s
next presidential candidate: Edwidge Owens.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:15.500
He watches a presidential debate where he
learns that Owens will be spending this year’s

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:20.260
Purge at a part religious cult / part political
cult ceremony called the Midnight Purge Mass,

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:24.060
and Bishop and his team of revolutionaries
plan to break in and assassinate him, ensuring

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.890
Roan the presidential victory.

00:09:27.129 --> 00:09:30.169
BISHOP: “The NFFA has created predatory capitalism.

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:33.720
Profit making is the essence of democracy.

00:09:34.728 --> 00:09:36.820
We’ve come to DC to make some changes.”

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:40.290
On Purge night, Bishop’s base of operations
is in one of the underground triage centers

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.940
which is supposed to be secure because only
the triage van drivers know its location.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.640
“We call this a safe zone.”

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:48.870
Bishop gets word that an attempt was made
on Senator Roan’s life and that she’ll

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.390
be taking refuge in his safe zone.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:54.360
He shows her around, helps her get settled
in and vows to use his armed men to keep her

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.360
safe.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:59.100
She does thank him for his protection, but
also confronts him about some of the “tactics”

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:01.240
he employs on Purge night that she doesn’t
agree with.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.730
She’s probably referring to the group’s
tendency to fight violence with violence.

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:07.890
He tells her that if she gets elected and
puts an end to Purge night, he won’t have

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.020
to do those things anymore.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:13.200
However, he’s not planning on leaving the
results of that election up to chance.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.980
This plan gets exposed when Senator Roan’s
private security detail, Leo Barnes, one of

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:21.240
the men that Bishop saved in 2023, goes behind
closed doors and discovers their plot to take

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.600
down Edwidge Owens.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.910
Roan vehemently objects, claiming that her
opponent must survive to lose the election,

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:30.240
otherwise he may become a martyr and risk
further civil retaliation.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:34.380
NFFA soldiers discover and storm the safe
zone, looking for Dante, but he’s already

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:35.529
gone when they arrive.

00:10:35.529 --> 00:10:39.530
He and his men are infiltrating a secret underground
tunnel into the cathedral where Owens’s

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.280
Midnight Purge Mass is being held.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.190
They encounter an unexpected ally.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:46.440
It’s Leo Barnes, the man in charge of keeping
Senator Roan alive.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:51.120
He explains that she’s been kidnapped by
the NFFA, that this is now a rescue mission.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.640
Barnes and his allies join Dante’s team
in the invasion.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:57.050
They split up so that Barnes takes the vantage
point at the balcony and Bishop and his men

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.420
enter from behind the altar.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:02.020
Barnes’s people are able to get off the
perfect shot to save the senator, but they’re

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:05.690
countered by a wave of secret service agents,
which Dante and his people catch by surprise

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:06.920
by coming up behind them.

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:11.370
It looks as if he may have remembered something
he learned 18 years ago at the Sandin house.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:15.410
His troops also capture minister Owens, and
Roan begs him to reconsider taking out her

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.410
political rival.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.326
“I can win without this, please.”

00:11:19.434 --> 00:11:20.574
“You will win.

00:11:20.574 --> 00:11:22.030
I’m gonna make sure that happens.”

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.570
When she tries to say that going through with
it will make him no different than the NFFA,

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:29.230
he tells his people to seize her, which leads
to a stand off between Barnes and Bishop.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.290
He brushes her off and goes into the room
where Owens is being kept.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.710
At this point the minister is encouraging
and begging him to Purge him, knowing that

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:39.070
the political ripple effect of his death would
benefit the NFFA.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:43.400
Dante finds himself on the other end of the
situation he was in in 2022, and like his

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:48.130
captor Mr. Sandin, Dante makes the decision
not to use violence to lower himself to the

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:51.940
level of the purgers and his parting words
to Roan are that she better win that election.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.560
They continue on to the next chamber where
Owens has dozens of prisoners who would have

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:59.340
been purged if Midnight Purge Mass had not
been broken up, but Bishop is more concerned

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:02.020
with leading the charge out of the church
to get Roan to safety.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:05.260
They make it to the parking lot, where they
come up against a group of mercenaries led

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:08.320
by the neo-Nazi NFFA henchman Earl Danzinger.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:12.000
Danzinger’s squad completely overpowers
them in terms of firepower -- he has several

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.310
men firing away with big automatic weapons.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:17.380
They take out two of Dante’s top guys and
shoot him in the hand.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:21.070
Leo comes to his aid, and Dante asks him to
cover him while he tries one last move.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:25.040
He hotwires a car and floors it across the
garage to take out two of the evil mercenaries,

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.700
but as soon as he does so, he is shot dead
by Danzinger.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:31.830
It is likely that without Dante Bishop’s
heroics, Leo and the others would have had

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:36.410
no chance to defeat Danzinger, get Senator
Roan and Edwidge Owens to safety and ultimately,

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:41.620
two months later on May 26th, defeat the NFFA
in the presidential election and finally put

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:45.370
an end to the nationwide Purge after at least
23 years.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:46.910
Was Dante Bishop perfect?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.910
Not by any means.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.980
Right from when we first meet him he’s a
killer, but we can see at the beginning it’s

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:55.290
only out of desperation to survive and he
does everything he can to avoid unnecessary

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:55.827
death.

00:12:55.827 --> 00:12:59.251
That night, he takes one more life in order
to save three innocent ones.

00:12:59.251 --> 00:13:02.370
However, he does let the experience shape
him in a negative way.

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:05.779
The following Purge he once again saves a
group of people, but he allows Carmelo’s

00:13:05.779 --> 00:13:09.480
vengeful ways to influence him and he stays
behind to do more fighting rather than help

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.030
the survivors get to safety.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.360
In the years that would follow, it’s implied
he does a lot of good with his organization

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.530
by helping the injured and the homeless, but
gets a mixed reputation based on how he goes

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.530
about things.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.470
Also, we can’t just look past the fact that
he just automatically knew how to hotwire

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:23.470
a car.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.830
He’s obviously up to some shady stuff, but
overall he did have good intentions and he

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:30.230
played a vital part in stopping the NFFA and
The Purge.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:34.580
If he and Carmelo hadn’t saved Leo Barnes
in 2023, Leo never would have been able to

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.580
protect Senator Roan in 2040.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.720
And if he hadn’t sacrificed himself in 2040,
who knows if she would have survived?

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.649
Let me know if the comments if there are any
other Purge characters you’d like to see

00:13:43.649 --> 00:13:45.450
covered here on Horror History.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:49.160
And if you love The Purge, I’ve got plenty
more Purge videos on the way, so check out

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:53.430
that playlist on the left and remember to
subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:57.850
week, ring the deathbell for notifications
and I’ll see you in the next one.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:59.660
Assuming we both survive.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:04.080
And just like the Purge, I recommend you stay
home, but if you have to go out, wear a mask.

